 "remarks": "Welcome to this beautifully updated one bedroom condo located in the highly sought after Harbor Point area of Stamford! Thoughtfully renovated, this inviting home features updated electrical, a completely remodeled kitchen with elegant granite countertops and brand new appliances, and a newer bathroom. Enjoy the convenience of in unit laundry, along with a generously sized bedroom offering ample closet space and direct access through sliding glass doors to your own private patio. One assigned parking space is included. Ideally situated just moments from Harbor Point's popular restaurants, the train station, and convenient access to I-95, this condo offers the best of both worlds: a prime location close to everything, yet tucked away in a peaceful, tranquil neighborhood setting. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy comfortable living in one of Stamford's most desirable areas!",
